How to run this project
Open terminals:

# Terminal 1 - Laravel App
php artisan serve --host=127.0.0.1 --port=8000

# Terminal 2 - Reverb WebSocket
php artisan reverb:start --host=127.0.0.1 --port=8080

# Terminal 3 - Nginx (optional)
cd C:\nginx
.\nginx.exe

Optional:
# Terminal 4 - Queue Worker (Broadcasting)
php artisan queue:work 
Processes background jobs (sending notifications when pharmacy status changes)

# Terminal 5 - (Vite (Frontend assets - only needed if editing the CSS/JS)) 
npm run dev 
(Skip this if you're not making frontend changes)



First-time setup (bagong machine):
composer install
npm install
copy .env.example .env
php artisan key:generate
php artisan migrate
php artisan storage:link


Checklist before opening the browser:
    PostgreSQL is running on port 5432
    .env has correct DB_PASSWORD set to root123
    Terminals 1, 2, and 3 are all running
    Open http://127.0.0.1:8000



